      "description": {
        "zh": "朗读 DSH 助手回复或选中的文字。默认使用 Edge 在线自然音色，断网时回退 Windows SAPI；支持逐句高亮、精确暂停/继续、0.5×–2× 语速、音色切换和右键划词朗读。",
        "en": "Read DSH assistant replies or selected text aloud. Uses Microsoft Edge natural voices by default and falls back to Windows SAPI offline; sentence highlighting, exact pause/resume, 0.5×–2× speed, voice switching, and a selection context menu."
